==Trivia==
* "Venator" was also a term used for scouts for the [[Zarosian Empire]].{{CiteText|text=Tatty page|quote=The venators worked their magic again. They have found some isolated woods on the far side of this new landmass, hidden behind some mountains.{{nbsp}}[...] The camp is complete and the venators have been dispatched to locate the dwarves.|loc=Desert Treasure II - The Fallen Empire}}{{CiteText|text=Venator bow|quote=A bow used by hunters from a forgotten empire.}}
** The term is shared as the [[vampyre]]s would have learned the word from [[Zaros]] when he visited [[Vampyrium]] and taught them society and culture.
* Despite the examine text stating they are [[Dog (disambiguation)|dogs]], venators do not count toward [[Slayer task/Dogs|dog Slayer tasks]].

